This is a NetworkCoin e-commerce template built with Vite, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui.

Key architecture:
- Cart state is managed via React Context (src/contexts/CartContext.tsx)
- Stripe integration is initialized in src/lib/stripe.ts using VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
- UI components are in src/components/ui/ (shadcn/ui primitives)
- Cart components: CartDrawer (slide-out sheet) and CartItem
- Checkout: CheckoutForm with shipping fields and Stripe CardElement placeholder
- Routing uses HashRouter from react-router-dom
- Styling uses Tailwind CSS with shadcn CSS variables for theming
